Cursed Energy: stdin
Split "\t"
Convert to Integers

Iterate 50000
    consider l of (x) -> length(x)
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> consider m as max(x) in
                          consider i as indexof(x, m) in
                          consider val as item(x, i) in
                          tuple(set(x, i, 0), i, val)
    Repeat
        Times: (x) -> item(x, 2)
        Apply
            Using: (x) -> consider ni as (item(x, 1) + 1) % l in
                          tuple(set(item(x, 0), ni, item(item(x,0), ni) + 1), ni, item(x, 2))
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> item(x, 0)
Map Each
        Map Each
            Using: (x) -> totext(x)
        Apply
            Using: (x) -> textjoin(x, "-")
Find Cycle
Part "1":
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> item(x, 0) + item(x, 1) + 1
    stdout
Part "2":
    Apply
        Using: (x) -> item(x, 1)
    stdout
